19, 2026, the labor arbitration claim was resolved following a second-instance court judgment. The Company shall pay 1) difference in
wages amounting to $9,270 (RMB63,941) between February 1, 2024 and June 30, 2024, 2) discrepancy in 2022 year-end bonus of $3,458 (RMB23,850),
and 3) the 2023 year-end bonus of $5,219 (RMB36,000). The Company settled the related amounts on August 24, 2026.</FONT></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Resolved
