was required to pay wage differentials for a specified period, together with an immaterial case filing fee. The Company settled the related
amounts of approximately $7,703 (RMB 54,837) in October 2025.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Appealed
Labor Dispute (Case 3)</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
December 2025, a first-instance judgment was issued in connection with another labor dispute, requiring the Company to make a payment
to the plaintiff. On May 22, 2026, the labor arbitration claim was resolved following a second-instance court judgment. The Company shall
pay 1) a compensation of $21,311 (RMB147,000) for unlawful termination of the employment relationship, 2) pay the salary differential
